  "topicExplanation": "Use **when** for time — something happens at the same time as something else (Japanese **～とき**).\n\n• **when + clause**: *Robin looks cute **when** he's sleeping.*\n• **When** at the start of a question: ***When** did he say he would come?*\n• **when** inside a sentence: *I wonder **when** the Civil War started.*",
